          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Next generation fluid management</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Designed for efficiency in urologic procedures</span></span></span></span></p>\n",
